      <p class="section__text">
        Bangladesh offers compelling advantages for polo shirt manufacturing, particularly for knit garments. As a <a href="/clothing-manufacturer-bangladesh" class="link">clothing manufacturer in Bangladesh</a>, our location provides cost advantages of 20-30% compared to China for equivalent quality. Bangladesh specializes in knitwear production, with polo shirts representing a core competency. Our <a href="/certifications" class="link">certifications</a> including GOTS and OEKO-TEX provide competitive advantages for brands targeting sustainability-conscious consumers. Lead times from Bangladesh to major markets are competitive: 22-28 days to US West Coast, 22-28 days to UK, and 25-35 days to Australia.
      </p>
      <p class="section__text">
        The LDC (Least Developed Country) trade preference provides duty-free access to EU markets through November 2026. For a $10,000 polo shirt shipment, this represents $1,200 in duty savings compared to Chinese imports. Bangladesh's knitwear infrastructure specializes in circular knitting machines ideal for polo shirt production. The industry's post-2013 safety reforms create one of the world's safest manufacturing environments. Sustainability credentials in Bangladesh's knitwear sector are strong, with GOTS certification widely available for organic cotton production. These advantages make Bangladesh the optimal choice for polo shirt manufacturing targeting global markets.
